### U1. Pure core: resolution, parser targets, new field specs (lib.ts)

**Goal:** the pure, ledger-free core — layer two configs, parse a `room` target,
and register all new knobs.

**Requirements:** R1, R2, R3, R5.

**Dependencies:** none (land first).

**Files:** `lib.ts`, `lib.test.ts`

**Approach:**
